    "title": "आसमान से क्या गिरा?",
    "title_en": "What fell from the sky?",
    "summary": "A blazing object crosses the sky over Madhopur in 2014. In the bazaar young Meera loses sight of her parents in the dust of an impact and calls for her mother. Villagers watch the object tear through distant fields and feel one enormous impact. On the farm road, Devendra and Suman Sharma's pickup drops nose-first into a ditch; a small boy is waiting outside the cracked window. Suman asks if he is hurt and he takes her hand. At the field's edge Devendra sees a massive dark blade-shaped craft, five storeys high, with a small open hatch at its base. He whispers Suman's name. The boy holds Suman's hand with both of his; his eyes glow blue and a pulse of light passes through his kurta.",
